        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Speculation rules webkit]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28663</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28663"/>
        <updated>2025-12-13T21:24:01.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10931297?u=600cfcb4c4e709dfbc66b328147d846ee87b1e51&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>

<p dir="auto">Webkit has implemented an initial version of Speculation Rules (prefetch only) behind a flag. This only includes some of Speculation Rules the features (notable no prerender but also a couple of other features).</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>

<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/526208490-0a8c7231-e278-4c67-ac7f-cfd8e180d2cb.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..uNrVM0Lf-ERzT97p6k3-Ke3RhcC2MH5LpJ-j66ukLIk"><img width="838" height="269" alt="image" src="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/526208490-0a8c7231-e278-4c67-ac7f-cfd8e180d2cb.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..uNrVM0Lf-ERzT97p6k3-Ke3RhcC2MH5LpJ-j66ukLIk" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 269px;"></a>
<p dir="auto">When you turn this on you (and restart Safari) you can visit <a href="https://chrome.dev/prerender-demos/prefetch.html" rel="nofollow">https://chrome.dev/prerender-demos/prefetch.html</a> and see the pages are prefetched:</p>
<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/526208926-f09ae810-18ac-4097-bd4c-83d0447010fc.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..BOCl2WflbKbMfLugruajXhJZn6LHhDdYjnnZZ2pewYk"><img width="1213" height="382" alt="image" src="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/526208926-f09ae810-18ac-4097-bd4c-83d0447010fc.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..BOCl2WflbKbMfLugruajXhJZn6LHhDdYjnnZZ2pewYk" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 382px;"></a>

<p dir="auto">Implementation bug: <a href="https://webkit.org/b/295193" rel="nofollow">https://webkit.org/b/295193</a></p>
<p dir="auto">Implemented in these PRs by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/yoavweiss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/yoavweiss">@yoavweiss</a> :<br>
<a href="https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pulls?q=is%3Apr+author%3Ayoavweiss+is%3Aclosed+SpeculationRules">https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pulls?q=is%3Apr+author%3Ayoavweiss+is%3Aclosed+SpeculationRules</a></p>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>

]]></content>
