<p dir="auto">Put in a supported value and not message, showing this is supported:</p>
<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/526206141-1d3d3f32-864c-4962-a7d3-e95df786be26.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..Al_HXoDJofk55eYW4J5poLpJ9W_139TlgZzlY4x-nIk"><img width="804" height="396" alt="image" src="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/526206141-1d3d3f32-864c-4962-a7d3-e95df786be26.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..Al_HXoDJofk55eYW4J5poLpJ9W_139TlgZzlY4x-nIk" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 396px;"></a>
<p dir="auto">Note for <code class="notranslate">&lt;ident&gt;</code> you should just use any custom value (e.g. <code class="notranslate">--test</code>) to show it is supported.</p>

